WEBVTT

00:11:28.023 --> 00:11:32.391
surrenders, travels toward reason.

00:11:32.391 --> 00:11:35.294
The heart fights among the swamps,

00:11:35.294 --> 00:11:38.819
skirts the edge of the underworld,

00:11:38.819 --> 00:11:43.101
falls exhausted, but won't give in
to what's easy,

00:11:43.101 --> 00:11:45.590
while irregular steps of intoxication

00:11:45.590 --> 00:11:47.167
wake up,

00:11:47.167 --> 00:11:49.057
wake the stillness.

00:11:49.057 --> 00:11:51.029
I'm Martín Bustamante,

00:11:51.756 --> 00:11:55.254
I'm a prisoner in Unit 48 of San Martín,

00:11:55.254 --> 00:11:58.112
today is my day of temporary release.

00:11:58.112 --> 00:12:01.784
And for me, poetry and literature
have changed my life.